  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-转化资产与事件管理\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"可通过接口查询确认客户未完成融合归因方案改造的异常资产。接入逻辑可参考 [巨量营销转化融合归因优化方案接入手册V2.0](https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/CgYBdVzoBogND2xv7PhcSfFNnyc)，接入中如有问题可通过【 [雅典娜工单](https://ad.oceanengine.com/athena/user-feedback/?identify_key=e8bdace58c96e8b79fe8b8aae5a496e983a8e4b893e58cba3136333935333733)】排查/联系对接销售，如您认可通过巨量平台完成归因也可接入转化SDK简化接入流程，详情参考 [「对外」巨量营销转化安卓端SDK使用说明 for 6.16.9手册](https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/docx/doxcnjAFo7iUImEIq9DuA7Tr69g)。接口仅返回异常资产内容，数据更新间隔为T+1。\",\"id\":\"marketing.abnormal_assets.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/event_manager/abnormal_assets/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1823745189417120\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"marketing.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1823745189417120\",\"title\":\"获取异常应用资产列表\"}",
